# THE AUDIO IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY.
#
# The soundtrack is sold separately, so it is the one class of extracted
# asset that does not get committed — the same line knight-sim draws. Each
# player runs tools/extract-gonermaker.sh against their own copy of the game.
# The interrogation is built to survive its absence: its typer is
# `snd_nosound`, so the drone is the only sound the scene has to lose.
assets/gonermaker/*.ogg
assets/gonermaker/*.wav

# The vendored simulator: a copy of another repository's build, dropped in by
# tools/vendor-knight.sh at merge time. See INTEGRATION.md.
DEVICE_KNIGHT/web/
DEVICE_KNIGHT/sim/
DEVICE_KNIGHT/render/
DEVICE_KNIGHT/input/
DEVICE_KNIGHT/assets/
DEVICE_KNIGHT/BUILD

.DS_Store
